Package: edf
Type: Package
Title: Read Data from European Data Format (EDF and EDF+) Files
Version: 1.0.1
Description: Import physiologic data stored in
    the European Data Format (EDF and EDF+) into R.
    Both EDF and EDF+ files are supported. Discontinuous
    EDF+ files are not yet supported.
Authors@R: c(person("Andreas", "Henelius", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "andreas.henelius@iki.fi"),
	   person("Finnish Institute of Occupational Health", role = c("cph")))
URL: https://github.com/bwrc/edf
Depends:
    R (>= 3.0.2)
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
